# Manifold level 3
# The machines (phase 3): what the program moves, and what signals move. Stage 3a: a ferry that leaves
# from a pit's edge, level with the floor (late, the character catches its edge and gets on: before 3a
# it was dragged along on it), and a platform that passes under a low beam (whoever rides it, the beam
# stops: before 3a the carry took it into the beam). Stage 3c: a button that opens a door, and plates
# that call a lift.
title The machines
spawn 3 1 6
facing 0 0 -1

# The start, its top at y = 0, as far as the pit (z = −10). (Until stage 3b the room started on the
# Dojo's own floor, which the Dojo built in every room.)
box 3 -0.5 -1     6 0.5 9     color #6f6a62  name start

# The ferry: level with both floors, 3 m long, across the 9 m pit and back, at the circuit's speed:
# 2.4 m/s (6 m in 2.5 s each way), from one edge to the other. At 2 m/s a late character got on even
# before 3a; at 2.4 it was caught on the edge.
box 3 -0.15 -11.5  1.5 0.15 1.5  move 0 0 -6 2.5  color #7a5a3a

# The floor across the pit, from where the ferry's run ends (z = −19): never under the ferry, whose top
# is at the same height (they overlapped 3 m, and the two surfaces flickered: the author saw it).
box 3 -0.5 -25    6 0.5 6     color #6f6a62

# On it, a platform 30 cm high going along X under a beam 20 cm above it: it passes, a character
# standing on it does not (the beam floats: it is the Dojo).
box 7 0.15 -25    1.5 0.15 1.5  move -8 0 0 4  color #7a5a3a
box 3 1.3 -25     0.25 0.8 3    color #5a4a38

# Stage 3c. A wall across the start, 2.2 m high, with a doorway, and its door: hinged at its left edge,
# it turns 90° away from the start in a second, while its signal is on (drawn with the door art/door.py
# makes: its size, its hinges on this edge). A button on the wall by the
# door (a red panel, and in front of it the zone where `use`, E, presses it): each press flips the door.
box -0.3 1.1 2    2.7 1.1 0.1   color #5a544c
box 6.3 1.1 2     2.7 1.1 0.1   color #5a544c
box 3 1.1 2       0.6 1.1 0.06  door -0.6 0 0 y 90 1 gate  color #8a6a42  model dojo.door  name door
box 4.4 1.2 2.13  0.12 0.12 0.03  color #c04040
sensor button     4.4 0.9 2.7   0.5 0.9 0.5  name button
signal pressed  used button
signal gate     toggle pressed

# Past the door, a lift beside a ledge 4.3 m high, with a star on it. Standing on the lift calls it up;
# a plate on the ledge calls it up too (if it is down), and a plate on the ground beside it calls it
# down. Up or down, it stays until it is called the other way (a latch); and while someone stands where
# it comes down, it does not (the call up wins).
box 7 0.15 -4     1 0.15 1      lift 0 4 0 3 lift_up  color #7a5a3a  name lift
box 7 2.15 -6     1.5 2.15 1    color #6f6a62  name ledge
box 4.6 0.025 -4  0.6 0.025 0.6  color #a04040
box 6.2 4.325 -6.3  0.5 0.025 0.5  color #a04040
sensor plate  7 0.8 -4      0.9 0.5 0.9  name on_lift
sensor plate  4.6 0.7 -4    0.6 0.7 0.6  name call_bottom
sensor plate  6.2 5 -6.3    0.5 0.7 0.5  name call_top
sensor star   7.8 5.2 -6.3  0.4 0.6 0.4
signal riding   zone on_lift
signal called   zone call_top
signal sent     zone call_bottom
signal up       any riding called
signal lift_up  latch up sent

# The void under it all (falling, back to the start or the checkpoint), and a checkpoint across the pit.
sensor fall        0 -6 -15     30 3 30
sensor checkpoint  3 0.8 -21    5 0.8 1.5
